<title>USA: Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the weekly U.S. grain and soybean export inspections due from the U.S. Agriculture Department Tuesday around 1000 CST are as follows, in millions of bushels. The data was delayed one day because of the U.S. Memorial Day holiday on Monday.</p>
<p>		     Range	    prev week</p>
<p> Soybeans	 5.0 to 10.0	5,500</p>
<p> All wheat     10.0 to 14.0	9,282</p>
<p> Corn	    23.0 to 29.0     28,274</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
